  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Happy School Girl Project (HSGP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed at providing reusable period panties (sanitary pads) to at1000 girls in Ghana annually. The HSGP is committed to ensuring menstrual dignity for girls while protecting the environment. Therefore investing in their menstrual hygiene management is consolidating girls education. An action which goes beyond LEARNING to guaranteeing their protection, support and empowerment to reach their full potential.</narrative>
  </description>
